# cpmrun script (build.sh): picosim's SYSGEN.SUB on the work disk in B:,
# with RMAC and LINK on C: and GENCPM on B:. A: boots (its PROFILE.SUB
# runs first; VT100DYN's cursor query takes typed keys, so wait it out).
! UNDEFINED SYMBOL
! ERROR
! NO FILE
> to see if it works
> A>
< B:
> B>
< C:RMAC BNKBIOS3 $PZ SZ
> END OF ASSEMBLY
> B>
< C:RMAC SCB $PZ SZ
> END OF ASSEMBLY
> B>
< C:LINK BNKBIOS3[B]=BNKBIOS3,SCB[NR]
> USE FACTOR
> B>
< GENCPM AUTO DISPLAY
> SYSTEM GENERATION DONE
> B>
